# fw_printenv and fw_setenv configuration
#
# Used purely as a key/value store for Nerves firmware metadata. lk2nd is
# the actual bootloader; U-Boot is not involved on this phone. The env area
# lives inside the stock `userdata` partition at offset 0x100000
# (UBOOT_ENV_OFFSET 2048 blocks * 512 = 1 MiB; UBOOT_ENV_COUNT 16 blocks *
# 512 = 8 KiB), see fwup_include/fwup-common.conf.
#
# /dev/nerves-userdata is the alias the initramfs creates for the partition
# whose GPT name is `userdata` (mmcblk0p26).

# Device name		Device offset	Env. size	Flash sector size	Number of sectors
/dev/nerves-userdata	0x100000	0x2000		0x200			16
